  "live.panel.13": "Session totals include manual mining and helpers, using the game's treasure-found counter. Adaptive speed: up to 20 tool actions/s. Survey detects hidden treasures. Bombs are used only when they cannot finish any treasure, and never during Auto Quests. Auto Battery needs Auto Mine ON.",
