  "live.panel.34": "Requires Auto Hatch. Appends eligible Pokémon up to this total or the native capacity. Existing entries remain in order. Paused while PKRS Mode or Auto Egg is ON. Turning OFF or changing filters leaves previously queued entries intact.",
