  "live.panel.37": "Second type",
  "live.panel.38": "Type efficiency = native breeding efficiency × hatchery regional multiplier × native attack modifier against the selected target types (including gems). Native efficiency = attack gained ÷ egg steps × egg-cycle multiplier, using the game's modifier setting. Weather and temporary attack boosts are excluded. Higher scores go first within eligible candidates. PKRS and priority rotation still take precedence.",
